		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Priest devoted to Chaos and the undoing of existence.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15 (plate mail), <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 scythe +3 (2d4 + poison) or 1 spell +6, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Conjure Chaos (WIS Spell)</strong>. DC 14. Summon gorgoros or gongorinan qlippoth within near for 5 rounds. Qlippoth has free will and is likely hostile to all mortals. Kiss of Entropy (WIS Spell). DC 15. Kiss a target of LV 6 or lower in close, go to 0 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 12+ or go to 0 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
